M-Extension-Server v1.0.5.0 is distributed under the Mozilla Public
License 2.0. The unmodified upstream tree at the exact commit recorded in
UPSTREAM is vendored here under upstream_src/; Hibiki's modified source
files are kept alongside it in overlay/ and server-build.gradle.patch and
are applied on top of that tree at build time.

Significant Hibiki modifications:

- loopback-only listener;
- mandatory random Bearer authentication for all routes;
- authenticated APK inspection using apksig;
- authenticated source image and source data clearing routes;
- Hibiki bridge capability identifier;
- catalogue identity preservation for legacy detail parsers;
- INVOKEINTERFACE correction in the bytecode rewriter.

Corresponding Source for shipped binaries is upstream_src/ plus
server-build.gradle.patch plus overlay/, all in this directory. The build
scripts under tool/mihon/ reproduce the combined source and take no
network dependency on the (now deleted) upstream repository.
